(text "IS-2 MOTHERBOARD: FOUR ABZ + TWO FREQUENCY + MPG A/B RECEIVER REGION r0.1" (at 17.78 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "05a3723d-4b09-5056-b96d-04c6d292bfb2"))
(text "All 16 receiver channels used; no receiver output NC. No galvanic isolation or cable-line-fault detector here.\n14 fitted 120R terminations; MPG R15/R16 DNP to avoid loading a 1mA TTL reference. Differential MPG needs a qualified termination variant.\nTerminated/disconnected or shorted pairs do not have guaranteed fail-safe state. Encoder validity must not be invented from a static output.\nNo probes, pendant shift register, sensor power limiter, 2.5V reference, accessory identity/presence or status frontend implemented in this receiver region." (at 17.78 450 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3508fb3a-ecb1-5b31-95cf-f365b369ed8b"))
(text "BOUNDARIES ARE NONPHYSICAL: no unverified connector MPN/footprint. Preserve XE0–3 / XF / XH1 logical field ordering.\n5V protected feeds and MPG_VREF enter from future parent regions; this block does not generate or protect them.\nInput bound: RS422 5.5V maximum differential for termination arithmetic; receiver common-mode -7..+7V, not a field-voltage rating.\nExternal line surge protection, source/cable load, footprints/stencil, thermal/EMC and rates still require qualification. Manufacturing blocked." (at 17.78 550 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2881c8de-9f5a-5278-bd22-e37df46a15ea"))
)
